{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "54e04e58b010854a021c1a3c8be897474c46450c377e8c0d9aed9e19505acda9", "ja": "憧れ", "zh": "憧憬", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1a70ba0902a0d407c007faa34c85e021bfac60a079883aa0f0db4ba23f342a81", "ja": "インタビューは朋花から静香へと続く。アイ\nドルに憧れる女の子たちに一言、と言われた\n静香は言葉に詰まってしまい、一旦保留に。\n静香は、今の自分に憧れて欲しくない、まだ\n夢を叶えられていないから、と語る。", "zh": "采访从朋花继续到静香。面对“请对憧憬偶像的女孩子们说一句话”的请求，静香一时语塞，只好暂且搁置。静香表示，她不希望大家憧憬现在的自己，因为她还没能实现梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "178b989cf6a441f44d94f8d6ce82e3ba0ad3b1c7dc68529bfac22f9e1d250a1f", "ja": "（アイドルのみんなへの、インタビューが続いている。\n小休憩を挟んで、朋花から再開だ……ふむふむ）", "zh": "（对偶像们的采访还在继续。短暂休息后，从朋花开始继续……嗯嗯）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "71b002062bd9ca6ab08a2ff5056167620adb8dd9f2e5f5230754e2c4cb3bf4ba", "ja": "天空橋さんは、どうして自分から\nアイドルになろうと思ったんですか？", "zh": "天空桥小姐为什么会主动想\n成为偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "070e86c1001a0f1142fb50306431c9b0d1f0f9bb3d556fbcd58ad7ba912667a3", "ja": "そうですね～……。\nそれが最善だと思ったから、でしょうか～？", "zh": "是这样呢～……\n因为我觉得那是最好的选择吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "02fed28ca8e3db56cb5bd3544d8b1112198dfcc1fb8dbb5f3340380b5d519cdd", "ja": "子豚ちゃんたちに、あまねく慈愛を届けること……\nそれが聖母としての、務めですから～。", "zh": "将慈爱平等地传递给小猪崽们……\n因为这就是圣母的职责呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1004_staff", "source_sha256": "e099c07fb39d1bd2602b1f5e9ca28c79fde068bdbf72cd7821cc839ab8007652", "ja": "なるほど……天空橋さんは、\n個性的な世界観を持っていますね。", "zh": "原来如此……天空桥小姐拥有独特的世界观呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "71757fc7415eacc8c8292ffcd21dd2ed9ae8ee5f348a353e826c5552f2c1ed9e", "ja": "そうですか～？　うふふ。アイドルになる前から、\nいつも悩んでいたんですよ～。", "zh": "是这样吗～？呵呵。在成为偶像之前，我也总是为此烦恼呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "944fe8041c73340579a966482e4908b6d11ec550a2f7947bfe836915070bb30a", "ja": "この世界には、迷える子豚ちゃんが多すぎますから。\nどうすればみんなを、正しい方向に導けるのかと……。", "zh": "因为这个世界上迷途的小猪仔实在太多了。\n我一直在想……究竟该怎样才能把大家引向正确的方向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "56f43f3ea32137e9640fe6101cc226018e1a50a33e8dd2cbace20d736d010218", "ja": "アイドルになる前から、そんなことを……\nやっぱり、朋花さんってすごいです！", "zh": "在成为偶像之前就已经在考虑这种事了……\n果然，朋花小姐真的很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "4e0d7898803c252a9553769f62a4bed8127430c329009580c717b3a768bfabcf", "ja": "信念っていうのかな。こぶ……ファンの\nみんなのためにっていう姿勢も、全然ブレないし。", "zh": "该说是信念吧。为了那些小猪……为了粉丝们的那份态度，也完全没有动摇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "5e93153a5247e5ebbafa9838a682c33a6ef8d20f35352851ef828f0b992a6d8f", "ja": "安定感がありますよね。子豚ちゃんたちが\n朋花さんに救いを求める気持ち、わかるなぁ。", "zh": "很有稳定感呢。我也完全能理解\n小猪仔们想向朋花小姐寻求救赎的心情啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "7ce478195cfe0f27d5b502698d91c395a02b5138fce9a41817e442f038909fc2", "ja": "うふふ、そんなに持ち上げないでください～。\n使命はありますが、私も同じアイドルです～。", "zh": "呵呵，请不要这么捧我啦～。\n虽然背负着使命，但我也同样只是一名偶像哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "4c96e2cf57410f23224276e5baa5b6c48cdcf3d4e7c22211fb9a2accf8f6990f", "ja": "それに、アイドルとしてだけではなく、聖母としても\n……みんなに教わることは、多いんですよ～？", "zh": "而且，不只是作为偶像，作为圣母也是如此……有很多东西需要向大家学习呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "bf4f3d3521cae193e6dcc087212802679d6ac252c3bce7eee6cbfb9f340a580f", "ja": "えっ、聖母としても、ですか？", "zh": "诶，作为圣母也是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "22aa59428527320393f958fcc30e2d080f1c6f467e6ea36f712d1df5379dc946", "ja": "ええ。たとえば、星梨花ちゃんの、\n知らないことを恐れずに、追いかける勇気……。", "zh": "是的。比如说，星梨花不畏惧未知、勇于追求的勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "0d09749ed471a915e47c1bcb595fd76ded503741d0ff060380cff44a877788bf", "ja": "先ほども話にありましたが、そういう素直さや、\n積極的なところは、聖母の資質だと思います～。", "zh": "刚才也提到过，像这种坦率，还有积极主动的一面，我觉得都是成为圣母的资质～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "a6c3ce301d96c74b6ce35bbbc639ea78036aea2d32745176f1eed4a5e6fe96a2", "ja": "ええっ！？　わたしが聖母ですか？\nえ、えへへ……。", "zh": "诶！？我、我吗？是圣母？\n诶、诶嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "624bcd4008d817a5aaf486a118cbafc77e24a594bab24811e827102ef2e5fec4", "ja": "それに百合子さんの、好きなことに対する\nぶれない気持ちや前向きな姿勢には、憧れますね～。", "zh": "而且，我也很憧憬百合子小姐对喜欢之事始终不动摇的心情，以及积极向前的态度呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "eb7bc42e8a417cb2c4e28e450b7a3504fd654266f23aa656b6e56fd44ff1119b", "ja": "と、朋花さんが、私に憧れを！？\nそんな、えへへ……♪", "zh": "朋花小姐居然会憧憬我！？怎么会，嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1018_staff", "source_sha256": "91097caaa6503270d6d46d18e40b667c020a92eafd3778210b3c6e57ed4c8127", "ja": "なるほど……みなさんそれぞれ個性的で、\nお互いを補い合っている、ということですね！", "zh": "原来如此……大家各有各的个性，能够互相取长补短，就是这么回事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "70809cc186c4d17c6a144a361b49b16f65c68778a13b0b939ef40faa6079fac6", "ja": "まとめると、そうなりますね～。", "zh": "总结起来，确实是这样呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1020_staff", "source_sha256": "80c38e35ab4e089b878f55089a6590c8d1d1e3c2f9301253377ea1bc778d75f3", "ja": "ありがとうございました！　では続いて……。\n最上さんもオーディションでしたよね？", "zh": "非常感谢！那么接下来……\n最上同学也是来参加选拔的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "5c0e5808c202886f8bcd1dfd759a00d1ae90ecd36e8ad357b3b4e145373e8825", "ja": "あ……は、はいっ！　ええと、私は……。\n小さい頃から、アイドルを目指していて。", "zh": "啊……是、是的！那个，我……从小就一直以偶像为目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "3412dcf6edee45aad598253d362aa51da5219e1eb8cf0ad6b985ccdabeb13a04", "ja": "だから最初は、デビューすること自体が目標でした。\n今は、トップアイドルを目指しています！", "zh": "所以一开始，能够出道本身就是我的目标。\n现在，我的目标是成为顶尖偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1023_staff", "source_sha256": "ab34b69067291a0041a3b7ffee6dc688f558a34be2f7fccf01583f40404c25f1", "ja": "なるほど。そんな最上さんは今、\nたくさんの女の子たちの目標になっているとか。", "zh": "原来如此。听说这样的最上小姐现在已经成为许多女孩子的目标了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1024_staff", "source_sha256": "e45706280442edea1bdcbf64574d356f0dcd75e16238e939a3a5bd5c1b578bf9", "ja": "そんな子たちに、\n何か言ってあげたいこととか、ありますか？", "zh": "对于那样的孩子们，\n有什么想对她们说的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "c64ea7920fee67bb29c95603d3956da4f70152847b769a03e0ec2e748572c5e0", "ja": "あ……ええと、それは……。\n……。", "zh": "啊……这个……那个……\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "f7b0994b1bef77778f7d9d6c3ff57d2da32f118fae3801153c708e09d87cb6d4", "ja": "……？\n静香さん？　どうしましたか？", "zh": "……？\n静香小姐？你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "9500f1990f707cea0cf0ca20872003019d5a4537abe63668c42d3bfb038cc5c9", "ja": "あ、ううん、なんでもないの！　大丈夫……\nええと、ごめんなさい、その……私は……。", "zh": "啊，不，没什么！我没事……\n那个，对不起，只是……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "cc383e5ec5bbf220f12b69a0b799b20766ff499f86f6e60d251345b148f7c1bc", "ja": "（おっと？　ここは……）", "zh": "（哦？这里是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_1029", "source_sha256": "5257fc84614311fe7603c01dc2b26062c0b1cda9c356ed3e564280a77eabee95", "ja": "ストップ", "zh": "停止", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "66e4da24939f7404ff5e746dabdf7269c5f86bfbd3e7e451049c41af659798c0", "ja": "すみません、今日のところはこれくらいで\nよろしいでしょうか？　もう結構長くなっていますし。", "zh": "抱歉，今天就先到这里，可以吗？时间也已经挺长了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2002_staff", "source_sha256": "3221476b0c2aa6d3447033bbdcb3e433d0f976e28c1aa10bb148a19b5614ecce", "ja": "そうですね！　まだ初日ですし。天海さんのお話も、\n次にしていただくという形で、よろしいですか？", "zh": "是啊！毕竟才是第一天。天海小姐的谈话，也请下次再进行，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "83f30ba61c666e007f29b1b68700630ad191000d0db9757727391cf243398c90", "ja": "はいっ、わかりました！　大丈夫ですよ。", "zh": "好的，明白了！没问题哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2004_015siz", "source_sha256": "263932d4e715523b6efddfba75fd8c95019906716734b4762ebd4099c2f98516", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい、春香さん……。", "zh": "对、对不起，春香前辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2005_001har", "source_sha256": "82e2f331b6c265aaa3061903f95a4ec3687352b20ae772800615a8d63acd9f27", "ja": "ううん、気にしないで。私もしっかり考えられて、\n助かっちゃったくらいだもん、ね？", "zh": "没事的，别放在心上。我也正好能好好思考一下，\n倒不如说帮大忙了呢，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2006_015siz", "source_sha256": "c27238ab9e24947490711e6600e107d86c75b23ede523c9dc9473af70000f0bd", "ja": "は、はい、そう言ってもらえると……。\n……うぅ。", "zh": "好、好的，你能这么说……  \n……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2007_p", "source_sha256": "b4cd95fbd45ebd9cd8a41387d3500377170848cdd3a9274695870b1528528b52", "ja": "（うーん、そこまで深刻そうでもないけど、\n一応フォローしておいた方がいいか……）", "zh": "（嗯——看起来也没那么严重，不过姑且还是安慰一下比较好吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2008_p", "source_sha256": "9c0a05a1fb0eca51dca453f605eb1ce4a1a55693998bb89968acd5059d9bb10f", "ja": "静香、お疲れさま。\nレッスンに、密着取材に……今日は忙しかったな。", "zh": "静香，辛苦了。\n练习、跟拍采访……今天真是忙了一天啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2009_015siz", "source_sha256": "ea3c0ea28aa5e653305fae98851f4576c8cf89f5547a4ce14c7c767afafde901", "ja": "{$P$}、さっきはすみません。\n助けてもらっちゃって。", "zh": "{$P$}，刚才真是对不起。\n还让你帮了我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2010_p", "source_sha256": "cf3de313ddd60b9448a5a534edd91d5a4b7c0576c6e1121dc82c3a5c739880e2", "ja": "いいって、そんなの。それより……大丈夫か？\nどうかしたのかなって、ちょっと心配で。", "zh": "这没什么的。比起那个……你还好吗？\n感觉你好像有点心不在焉，我有点担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2011_015siz", "source_sha256": "36d947b870cfb0e2dc13564e947cb139312a5563c0db04f686098a4684d3c8ea", "ja": "私の態度、やっぱりヘンでしたよね。\n……質問された時、一瞬、考えちゃったんです。", "zh": "我的态度，果然很奇怪吧。\n……被问到的时候，我一瞬间犹豫了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2012_015siz", "source_sha256": "9d9e7727f45e4216acf89dbc599a64f70a5da22c9648019bc9df99d0debea181", "ja": "私……今の自分には、憧れて欲しくないなって。", "zh": "我……觉得现在的自己，不值得被人憧憬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2013_p", "source_sha256": "c05c0b4daed084c5b96ef80aab247943c1a6008b264067b30aa0e4af31f93cdc", "ja": "ふむ……。\n理由、聞かせてもらってもいいか？", "zh": "嗯……能告诉我理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2014_015siz", "source_sha256": "46cffdb6d8889017f99a50c1245c21be0040da30593d13a2a92319775544e2cd", "ja": "なにより私自身が、憧れられないからです。\nだって私、まだ途中だから。まだ夢に届いてない……。", "zh": "因为最重要的是，我自己还没能成为令人憧憬的对象。\n毕竟我还在途中。还没有抵达梦想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2015_015siz", "source_sha256": "f66b149c6e25e0412086f9412b2d4404ceb88bb02aa7feda981095c27418d627", "ja": "もちろんトップアイドルになるために、\nできることは、精いっぱいやっているつもりです。", "zh": "当然，为了成为顶尖偶像，\n我也在尽自己所能努力着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2016_015siz", "source_sha256": "6212b63d8c16c1e013a5533c701cfea39045575c6b488f89e4b3b29a3c1a7068", "ja": "でも……だからこそ、何も言えない……。\n努力しても、まだ届いてないのに。", "zh": "可是……正因为如此，才什么都说不出口……\n明明已经努力了，却还是没能达到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2017_p", "source_sha256": "2890db1b44850e3cb8ada2dfd325bf9baf47bfd7962a3e95c1cf30601dc4a8fe", "ja": "うーん……そんな等身大の静香だからこそ、憧れて\nもらえたんだと思うけど……そういう事じゃないよな。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得，正因为你是这样真实的静香，大家才会憧憬你……但不是这个意思吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2018_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8fc512070936213bf2b799a505423016bab5c0f7f017375b57683988d3c25a2", "ja": "はい……正直に言ったら、突き放すみたいかなって\n思ったら、言葉が出なくなってしまって。", "zh": "是……我只是想到，要是实话实说，感觉像是在把对方拒之门外，所以就说不出话来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2019_015siz", "source_sha256": "20057fe215952d8e5e9e8817208cdee3a612fb3e19d588c026de6c4561c188fa", "ja": "……っと、すみません！　私、そろそろ帰らなきゃ。\nあの、答え、ちゃんと考えておきますね。", "zh": "……啊，不好意思！我差不多该回去了。\n那个，我会好好考虑一下回答的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_04_2020_p", "source_sha256": "df148c3031b16b95aa07071486416cb5ba14efd489a1f4dff40785119f90d672", "ja": "（憧れられる側の悩み、か……。\nさて、静香のために、なにができるだろう？）", "zh": "（被憧憬着的一方所烦恼的事吗……。那么，我能为静香做些什么呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
